    {"id": "REQ-TC-04", "ssot": "§23 TC-04", "requirement": "Conformance test TC-04 (SSOT §23).", "kind": "tested", "status": "pass", "conformance_test": "TC-04", "equations": [], "claims": [], "lean": [], "tests": ["test_production.py::test_production_core_matches_reference_trajectory", "test_production_validation.py::test_full_model_signal_matches_reference_until_first_event", "test_production_validation.py::test_full_model_matches_reference_trajectory", "test_production_validation.py::test_full_model_matches_reference_trajectory_allostatic", "test_production_validation.py::test_full_model_decides_from_existing_signal", "test_production_validation.py::test_full_model_applies_retention_on_ignition"], "limitation": "apgi-implementation's default core equals the reference step for step (CFG-CORE, CFG-CORE-R). apgi_core.full_model (apgi-validation 604a3d9, task 62c: aligned) equals apgi_ref.core_step in S, θ, Bₜ and B(t) for 600 seeded steps, with CORE_DEFAULTS and with every allostatic term on (θ_floor binding); eight planted faults are caught. full_model has no θ_eff modulators (NE, 5-HT, refractory, urgency), so its comparison covers θ_eff = θ; the declared variant apgi_core.model (SSOT-V1) is excluded by label.", "record_status": "Proposed", "owner": "Uxod", "approval_date": null},
